WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.132
Bua ngi SaloneHCM government modules gboyɛi ma.

2
00:00:03.132 --> 00:00:15.272
SaloneHCM ɛ Gov tier-nga ya lɔ ngi controls-nga nɛni public payroll-a wɔndɛi yɛ: civil service salary structure, establishment discipline, budget checks kɛ mɔni i ti vuli kɔ, ɓɛ public transparency.

3
00:00:15.272 --> 00:00:17.050
Mu ya lɔ i ti gbɛnɛ kɔɔ kɔkɔ.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:24.748
Civil service module-a ya lɔ ngi bi grade ɓɛ step salary matrix, allowance rules-nga, ɓɛ budget codes-nga.

5
00:00:24.748 --> 00:00:36.089
Salaries-a ya hulɛi structure-nga gɔi — kɛ ti ad-hoc nɔmbɛi gɔi — kɛ grade seven step three officer ji i yɛ Bo ya, a salary-a ya lɔi ngi structure-a fɛlɛ-ɓɛi, hɔndɛ lɔ i yɛ Freetown ya.

6
00:00:36.089 --> 00:00:39.706
Retro-pay ɓɛ ghost-worker audit tools-nga hɔ́n yɛ yaa gbɛɛ.

7
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:46.740
Establishment control-a ya lɔ ngi kɛ i pɛtɛ approved posts-nga ɓɛ filled posts-nga, ministry kɔkɔ kpindi.

8
00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:54.218
Over-establishment hiring-a ya flag-ngi kɛ i ti lɔ payroll liability kɔ, ɓɛ vacancies-nga ya hɔnɛi workforce planning-yɛ.

9
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:26.081
Payroll run kɔkɔ i ti commit kɔ kɛ, budget check-a ya lɔ ngi kɛ i piali kɛ allocation i yɛ budget code kɔkɔ kpindi nɛni run-a nya bi yambɛ-ɓɛi.

10
00:01:26.081 --> 00:01:32.997
Sɔ code jii yɛ over kɔ, run-a ya block-ngi — ɓɛ documented override-ɛ ɓɛ reason ji kɛndɛ nɔ nya lɔ i ti wili kɔ.

11
00:01:32.997 --> 00:01:38.802
Payroll page-a kɔ, budget balances panel-a ya lɔ ngi kɛ i hɔnɛ lɛlɛ nɛni code kɔkɔ ya yɛ yila.

12
00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:53.291
Kɛ kpɔtɔnga nya ya lɔ, open-gov transparency portal-a — public page, login i tó wɔndɛi — ya publish-ngi aggregate payroll statistics-nga bi ministry-yɛ: headcount, wage bill trends-nga, ɓɛ grade distributions-nga.

13
00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:58.250
Citizens-a ɓɛ journalists-a ya hɔnɛi nɔmbɛi-nga; personal data-a ya lɔ protected.

14
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:07.080
Structure, establishment, budget discipline, ɓɛ daylight — hɔ́n yɛ pillar-a nawɛii clean government payroll-yɛ.

15
00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:12.802
Bi government modules quiz-a bi Training Center-a kɔ kɛ bi ya lɔ bi certification-a guhu-ɓɛi.
